<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: As the old, derelict ship entered the lower orbit, a sudden systems failure triggered a catastrophic malfunction. Not sure if it was due to the ship’s advanced age, a critical hardware failure, or a long-dormant virus in the AI-core, we quickly realized it didn’t matter. Our colony of insectors, long misunderstood and striving to survive, was in chaos. In our panic, we instinctively swarmed towards the escape pods, desperate to flee the impending disaster.\n\nIn our haste, we accidentally launched the pods, leaving the human crew behind in their cryptosleep chambers, unaware and doomed. The ship split into numerous chunks as it rapidly descended onto the surface. Amid the pandemonium, we could only hope that perhaps some things could still be recovered from the wreckage.\n\nNote: Since you start crash landing and with very little supplies, this is a difficult scenario.-->
  <VRE_InfestedCrash.description>当破旧的飞船驶入近地轨道航行时，突如其来的系统故障引起了灾难性的事故。飞船年龄太过古老、重要硬件损坏、AI核心被长期潜伏的病毒劫持...这些可能性在脑海中迅速闪过，但你很快便意识到这已经无关紧要了。你和其他几名异虫种船员长期以来遭人误解，为活下去而吃尽了苦头。在惊恐与混乱之中，求生的本能驱使你们冲向了救生舱。\n\n等回过神来，你发现有人提前按下了救生舱内的“弹射”按钮，然而还有许多处于低温休眠室内的船员未被唤醒，只能被留在里面等死。飞船在坠毁过程中变得四分五裂，但好在你们平安着陆了。为了今后的生存，你们打量起了散落在附近的飞船残骸。也许仍能从中搜出些有价值的东西？\n\n注意：由于开局是以迫降的方式抵达的，这些可拆除的飞船残骸和少量物资便是你仅有的资源。这是个高难度的剧本。</VRE_InfestedCrash.description>
  <!--EN: Infested Ship-->
  <VRE_InfestedCrash.label>感染的飞船</VRE_InfestedCrash.label>
  <!--EN: Start with six insectors.-->
  <VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.parts.0.customSummary>从六只昆虫开始。</VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.parts.0.customSummary>
  <!--EN: adult insector-->
  <VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.parts.0.xenotypeCounts.0.description>成人昆虫</VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.parts.0.xenotypeCounts.0.description>
  <!--EN: As the old, derelict ship entered the lower orbit, a sudden systems failure triggered a catastrophic malfunction. Not sure if it was due to the ship’s advanced age, a critical hardware failure, or a long-dormant virus in the AI-core, we quickly realized it didn’t matter. Our colony of insectors, long misunderstood and striving to survive, was in chaos. In our panic, we instinctively swarmed towards the escape pods, desperate to flee the impending disaster.\n\nIn our haste, we accidentally launched the pods, leaving the human crew behind in their cryptosleep chambers, unaware and doomed. The ship split into numerous chunks as it rapidly descended onto the surface. Amid the pandemonium, we could only hope that perhaps some things could still be recovered from the wreckage.-->
  <VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.parts.7.text>当这艘废弃的旧飞船进入较低轨道时，突然的系统故障引发了灾难性的故障。不确定这是否是由于飞船年事已高、严重的硬件故障或人工智能核心中长期休眠的病毒所致，但我们很快意识到这并不重要。我们的昆虫群体长期被误解并努力生存，陷入了混乱。在恐慌中，我们本能地涌向逃生舱，不顾一切地想要逃离即将到来的灾难。

在匆忙中，我们不小心发射了逃生舱，将人类船员留在了他们的加密睡眠室中，毫无意识到并注定要失败。当船迅速降落到水面时，它分裂成无数块。在一片混乱中，我们只能希望也许还能从残骸中找回一些东西。</VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.parts.7.text>
  <!--EN: A hive of insectors, crashlanding in the wilderness. A classic VRE - Insector experience.-->
  <VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.summary>一群在荒无人烟之地迫降的异虫种 - VE异虫种扩展经典的开局模式。</VRE_InfestedCrash.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
